# Wildcard first: every text file is LF in the repo and in the checkout
# (workspace tooling rule 7). A CRLF in gradlew breaks the bash shebang on the
# Linux CI runner.
* text=auto eol=lf
gradlew text eol=lf
*.kts   text eol=lf
*.wit   text eol=lf

# Binaries: the wrapper jar and the wasm fixtures (their bytes are hashed).
*.jar   binary
*.wasm  binary
